      "text": "5\n\n0\nOutside Cave\nYou are standing outside a dark cave.\nA cold wind blows from the north.\n%%\nnorth:1\n%%\n1\nCave Entrance\nYou are at the entrance of the cave.\nThe tunnel continues deeper.\n%%\nsouth:0\neast:2\nwest:3\n%%\n2\nUnderground Lake\nA large underground lake blocks your path.\nThe water looks very deep.\n%%\nwest:1\nnorth:4\n%%\n3\nOld Storage Room\nDusty crates and broken tools are scattered around.\n%%\neast:1\n%%\n4\nTreasure Chamber\nYou have found the treasure chamber!\nGold and jewels sparkle everywhere.\n%%\nsouth:2\nquit:-1\n%%",
      "fontSize": 20.598831259180965,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5\n\n0\nOutside Cave\nYou are standing outside a dark cave.\nA cold wind blows from the north.\n%%\nnorth:1\n%%\n1\nCave Entrance\nYou are at the entrance of the cave.\nThe tunnel continues deeper.\n%%\nsouth:0\neast:2\nwest:3\n%%\n2\nUnderground Lake\nA large underground lake blocks your path.\nThe water looks very deep.\n%%\nwest:1\nnorth:4\n%%\n3\nOld Storage Room\nDusty crates and broken tools are scattered around.\n%%\neast:1\n%%\n4\nTreasure Chamber\nYou have found the treasure chamber!\nGold and jewels sparkle everywhere.\n%%\nsouth:2\nquit:-1\n%%",
